# For configuration options and examples, please see:
# https://gethomepage.dev/latest/configs/bookmarks
#
# DELIBERATELY EMPTY, and it must stay present rather than be deleted. homepage seeds any
# config file it finds MISSING into /app/config at startup, which EROFSes on this role's
# read-only mount and crash-loops the pod — an empty file is not a missing one.
#
# The five personal links that lived here are SERVICE tiles in the `Calendar` group of
# services.yaml.j2 now. That is the only way to place them in the calendar column: a bookmark
# group cannot be laid out inside `Top Row` at any depth, and homepage says nothing when it
# refuses — it drops the group out and renders it last at full width (#1488, #1490).
#
# Re-adding a bookmark here also needs a `Bookmarks:` entry in settings.yaml.j2's `layout`, at
# TOP LEVEL. Without one the group still renders, but below every laid-out group and one column
# wide.
